        "style": "c",
        "sid": "HOS 14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "14",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O Israel, return unto the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.14.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.14.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thy God; for thou hast fallen by thine iniquity.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Take with you words, and turn to the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.14.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.14.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ": say unto him, Take away all iniquity, and receive",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "us",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.14.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.14.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "graciously: so will we render the calves of our lips.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asshur shall not save us; we will not ride upon horses: neither will we say any more to the work of our hands,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Ye are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.14.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.14.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "our gods: for in thee the fatherless findeth mercy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.14.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ I will heal their backsliding, I will love them freely: for mine anger is turned away from him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will be as the dew unto Israel: he shall grow as the lily, and cast forth his roots as Lebanon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "His branches shall spread, and his beauty shall be as the olive tree, and his smell as Lebanon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They that dwell under his shadow shall return; they shall revive",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "as",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.14.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.14.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the corn, and grow as the vine: the scent thereof",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.14.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.14.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as the wine of Lebanon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.14.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ephraim",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall say",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.14.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.14.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", What have I to do any more with idols? I have heard",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "him",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.14.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.14.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and observed him: I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.14.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.14.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "like a green fir tree. From me is thy fruit found.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Who",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.14.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.14.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wise, and he shall understand these",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "things",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.14.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.14.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "? prudent, and he shall know them? for the ways of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.14.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.14.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.14.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.14.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "right, and the just shall walk in them: but the transgressors shall fall therein.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.14.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
